---
const CTA_URL =
  "https://tally.so/r/3EGbZA?utm_source=website&utm_medium=clarity_check_section&utm_campaign=clarity_check_launch";
---

<section class="bg-primary-900 py-20">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-16">
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 text-left">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary-400 mb-4">New</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-secondary-400 mb-6">
          Take the Crown Clarity Check
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-white mb-4">
          See where your finance stack really stands, before investors ask.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-lg text-white/90">
          <p>
            We built the Clarity Check to help founders cut through the noise. It’s a short
            self-assessment that reveals how structured your financial operations actually are and
            what to fix before you overspend or overhire.
          </p>
          <p>
            In just a few minutes, you’ll uncover how your business measures up across bookkeeping,
            forecasting, and operational clarity.
          </p>
          <p>
            No spreadsheets. No jargon. Just a clear view of where you stand and what comes next.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10">
          <a
            href={CTA_URL}
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-secondary-400 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 shadow-lg transition-transform duration-200 hover:scale-[1.02] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-secondary-200"
            data-clarity-check-cta
          >
            Take the Clarity Check
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-secondary-400/50 bg-primary-800/60 p-4 shadow-2xl">
          <video
            class="w-full rounded-xl border border-secondary-400/30"
            controls
            playsinline
            preload="metadata"
            poster="/images/clarity-check-poster.png"
          >
            <source
              src="/videos/clarity-check.mp4"
              type="video/mp4"
            />
            Your browser does not support the video tag.
          </video>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-secondary-400">
            Watch how it works → A quick walkthrough of the Clarity Check experience.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="module">
  import { trackEvent } from "../../utils/analytics";

  const setupCTAAnalytics = () => {
    const button = document.querySelector('[data-clarity-check-cta]');
    if (!button) return;

    button.addEventListener('click', () => {
      trackEvent('cta_click', { section: 'clarity_check' });
    });
  };

  if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', setupCTAAnalytics, { once: true });
  } else {
    setupCTAAnalytics();
  }
</script>
